[
  {
    "file": "实验报告.docx",
    "sha256": "133d8d090784d9228cf2ba5c59b8047246a0cbe64d6c40cfc9a1d53fa85d094f",
    "body": [
      {
        "index": 0,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Western blot实验报告"
      },
      {
        "index": 1,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "一、Western blot实验步骤"
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "1.组织匀浆及蛋白的提取   剪取组织，称重，每个样品重量在100mg左右，加入RIPA细胞裂解液1ml（内含1mM PMSF）进行裂解。12,000rpm离心10min。收集上清液，即含有组织总蛋白。"
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "2. 电泳(1) SDS-PAGE凝胶配制    使用碧云天生产的SDS-PAGE凝胶配制试剂盒。浓缩胶和分离胶的配方分别如下："
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "浓缩胶（2ml）                              10%分离胶（5ml）"
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "双蒸水               1.4ml                   双蒸水               1.9ml"
      },
      {
        "index": 6,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "30%丙烯酰胺混合液    330ul                   30%丙烯酰胺混合液    1.7ml"
      },
      {
        "index": 7,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "1.0molTris(PH6.8)    250ul                   1.5molTris(PH8.8)    1.3ml"
      },
      {
        "index": 8,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "10%SDS               20ul                    10%SDS               50ul"
      },
      {
        "index": 9,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "10%AP                20ul                    10%AP                50ul"
      },
      {
        "index": 10,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "TEMED                2ul                     TEMED                2ul"
      },
      {
        "index": 11,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 12,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "(2) 样品处理"
      },
      {
        "index": 13,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "   在收集的蛋白样品中按照1:4加入5X SDS-PAGE蛋白上样缓冲液。沸水浴加热10分钟，以充分变性蛋白。"
      },
      {
        "index": 14,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "(3) 上样与电泳"
      },
      {
        "index": 15,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "    待样品冷却到室温后，把蛋白样品直接上样到SDS-PAGE胶加样孔内即可。每孔加5-10ul。浓缩胶所用电压为80v，时间为30分钟；分离胶所用电压为120v，时间为1小时。"
      },
      {
        "index": 16,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "3. 转膜"
      },
      {
        "index": 17,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "将预先裁好与胶条同样大小的滤纸和PVDF膜（预先在甲醇中浸泡2-3分钟），浸入转膜缓冲液中5分钟。转膜装置从上至下依次按阳极板、3层滤纸、PVDF膜、凝胶、3层滤纸、阴极板的顺序放好，滤纸、凝胶、PVDF膜精确对齐，每一步都要去除气泡。恒流转膜，具体转模时间如下。"
      },
      {
        "index": 18,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 19,
        "type": "table",
        "rows": [
          [
            "蛋白名称",
            "分子量",
            "转膜时间（min）"
          ],
          [
            "AT1R",
            "39kDa",
            "40"
          ],
          [
            "RhoA",
            "22 kDa",
            "25"
          ],
          [
            "Rock1",
            "158kDa",
            "90"
          ],
          [
            "Rock2",
            "161kDa",
            "90"
          ],
          [
            "Nox1",
            "62kDa",
            "55"
          ],
          [
            "Nox4",
            "64kDa",
            "55"
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 20,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 21,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "4. 封闭"
      },
      {
        "index": 22,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "   转膜完毕后，立即把蛋白膜放置到预先准备好的Western洗涤液中，漂洗5分钟，以洗去膜上的转膜液。加入Western封闭液（5%脱脂奶粉），在摇床上缓慢摇动,室温封闭2小时。"
      },
      {
        "index": 23,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "5. 一抗孵育"
      },
      {
        "index": 24,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "   参考一抗的说明书，按照合适的比例用一抗稀释液进行稀释,4℃缓慢摇动孵育过夜。加入洗涤液（PBST），每次洗涤10分钟，共洗涤3次。"
      },
      {
        "index": 25,
        "type": "table",
        "rows": [
          [
            "抗体名称",
            "稀释比例",
            "种属"
          ],
          [
            "AT1R",
            "1：1000",
            "Rabbit"
          ],
          [
            "RhoA",
            "1：5000",
            "Rabbit"
          ],
          [
            "Rock1",
            "1：1000",
            "Rabbit"
          ],
          [
            "Rock2",
            "1：1000",
            "Rabbit"
          ],
          [
            "Nox1",
            "1：1000",
            "Rabbit"
          ],
          [
            "Nox4",
            "1：1000",
            "Rabbit"
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 26,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 27,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "6. 二抗孵育"
      },
      {
        "index": 28,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "参考二抗的说明书，按照1:20000用二抗稀释液稀释辣根过氧化物酶(HRP)标记的二抗。室温孵育1.2小时。加入洗涤液（PBST），每次洗涤10分钟，共洗涤3次。"
      },
      {
        "index": 29,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "7. 蛋白检测"
      },
      {
        "index": 30,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "参考相关说明书，使用ECL发光试剂盒来检测蛋白。"
      },
      {
        "index": 31,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "附录：试剂配方"
      },
      {
        "index": 32,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "1. 10％SDS "
      },
      {
        "index": 33,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "SDS                  10g "
      },
      {
        "index": 34,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "蒸馏水至                  100ml "
      },
      {
        "index": 35,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "50℃水浴下溶解，室温保存。 "
      },
      {
        "index": 36,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 37,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "2. 10％过硫酸胺（10%AP） "
      },
      {
        "index": 38,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "APS                       0.1g "
      },
      {
        "index": 39,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "超纯水                  1.0ml "
      },
      {
        "index": 40,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "溶解后，4℃保存，保存时间为1周。"
      },
      {
        "index": 41,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": " "
      },
      {
        "index": 42,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "3. 30％(w/v)丙烯酰胺溶液"
      },
      {
        "index": 43,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Acrylamide                29g"
      },
      {
        "index": 44,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Bis-Acrylamide                  1g"
      },
      {
        "index": 45,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "加去离子水，定容至 100ml 调整溶液 pH 值不超过 7.0，置棕色瓶中贮存于4℃。"
      },
      {
        "index": 46,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 47,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "4. 5×电泳液配方(1000ml)"
      },
      {
        "index": 48,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Tris      15.1g"
      },
      {
        "index": 49,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Glycine   94g"
      },
      {
        "index": 50,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "SDS       5.0g"
      },
      {
        "index": 51,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "加去离子水，定容至 1000ml"
      },
      {
        "index": 52,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 53,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "5.转膜液配方（1000ml）"
      },
      {
        "index": 54,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Tris      5.8g"
      },
      {
        "index": 55,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Glycine   2.9g"
      },
      {
        "index": 56,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "SDS       0.37g"
      },
      {
        "index": 57,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "甲醇      200ml"
      },
      {
        "index": 58,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "加去离子水，定容至 1000ml"
      },
      {
        "index": 59,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 60,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "6.1.0M Tris（pH 6.8）"
      },
      {
        "index": 61,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Tris  121.1g"
      },
      {
        "index": 62,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "加入约800mL去离子水，加入浓盐酸调整溶液 pH 值为6.8，定容至1000mL，高温高压灭菌后室温保存。"
      },
      {
        "index": 63,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 64,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "7.1.5M Tris（pH 8.8）"
      },
      {
        "index": 65,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Tris  181.7g"
      },
      {
        "index": 66,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "加入约800mL去离子水，加入浓盐酸调整溶液 pH 值为8.8，定容至1000mL，高温高压灭菌后室温保存。"
      },
      {
