  {
    "file": "实时荧光定量PCR报告.docx",
    "sha256": "b2f784e07841135e48e6c98dcb3f245ab2f68f011be90f0458a71fbae4cc798e",
    "body": [
      {
        "index": 0,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "实时荧光定量PCR实验报告"
      },
      {
        "index": 1,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "实时荧光定量PCR实验步骤"
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "RNA提取"
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "1）称取组织50-100mg，剪碎，液氮研磨，加入1ml TRIzol裂解。"
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "2）加入0.2mL氯仿，剧烈振荡15秒，室温放置5分钟。 "
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "3）4℃ 12000rpm 离心10分钟，取上清（约500ul）加入到另一EP管中。"
      },
      {
        "index": 6,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "4）加入0.5mL预冷的异丙醇，温和混匀，冰上孵育30分钟。 "
      },
      {
        "index": 7,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "5）4℃ 12000rpm 离心15分钟，弃去上清。 "
      },
      {
        "index": 8,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "6）加入1mL预冷的 75℅乙醇。4℃ 12000rpm离心5分钟，弃上清。 "
      },
      {
        "index": 9,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "7）重复步骤6）。"
      },
      {
        "index": 10,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "8）室温干燥RNA沉淀，加入20-50 μL DEPC水, -80℃保存备用。 "
      },
      {
        "index": 11,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "RT反应"
      },
      {
        "index": 12,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "1） 去除基因组 DNA 反应：在0.2mL EP管中，加入总RNA（质量为1µg）、5×gDNA Eraser Buffer 2.0μL，gDNA Eraser 1.0μL，DEPC水补足至10μL，轻轻混匀、点动离心。"
      },
      {
        "index": 13,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "PCR仪上42℃加热2min，立即冰浴1min。"
      },
      {
        "index": 14,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "在上述EP管中加入PrimeScript RT Enzyme Mix I 1.0μL、RT Primer Mix 1.0μL、RNase Free dH2O 4.0μL、RevertAidTM M-MuLV Reverse Transcniptase 4.0μL。"
      },
      {
        "index": 15,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "37℃，15min；85℃，5s 。"
      },
      {
        "index": 16,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "取出上述反应液，即为cDNA，-80℃ 保存备用。"
      },
      {
        "index": 17,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "荧光定量PCR反应"
      },
      {
        "index": 18,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "1）取出cDNA作为荧光定量的模板，反应体系如下："
      },
      {
        "index": 19,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 20,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 21,
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": ""
